1	option	Ask about the quest.
2	cond	If the player has pickpocketed Martin before:
3	line	Martin the Master Gardener	Hello, {player}, you look familiar. Didn't I catch you going through my pockets not that long ago?
3	line	Player	Me? No, I'm afraid you must have me confused with somebody else!
3	line	Martin the Master Gardener	I could have sworn ...
3	line	Martin the Master Gardener	Oh well, never mind. I have bigger problems to worry about right now.
3	action	continues
2	cond	If the player hasn't pickpocketed Martin before:
3	line	Player	Hello.
3	line	Martin the Master Gardener	I can't chat now, I have too many things to worry about.
3	action	continues
2	select	Select an Option
2	option	Anything I can help with?
3	line	Martin the Master Gardener	I certainly could do with some help.
3	line	Player	So tell me about your problems.
3	line	Martin the Master Gardener	It all seemed to start about a month ago. I grow roses, you know?
3	line	Player	Um, you seem to be getting side-tracked already.
3	line	Martin the Master Gardener	What? Oh sorry.
3	line	Martin the Master Gardener	As I was saying about a month ago I noticed that the yield on my prize rose bushes had dropped slightly. I immediately suspected Crown Gall, a disease that can be fatal to a Mister Lincoln.
3	line	Player	You're not making much sense. Who's Mister Lincoln?
3	line	Martin the Master Gardener	Sorry, Mister Lincoln's are the variety of roses that I specialise in. None of the plants showed any other symptoms of disease though. Then I noticed a reduced yield occurring in most of my other crops too.
3	line	Martin the Master Gardener	I spoke to other gardeners that I know, and they had all noticed similar problems.
3	line	Martin the Master Gardener	Vegetable patches are growing fewer vegetables, bushes are producing fewer berries and everything that is planted seems to be more prone to disease!
3	cond	If the player hasn't trained their Farming:
4	line	Martin the Master Gardener	If you were more interested in turning your hand to farming, you would have noticed it too.
4	action	continues
3	cond	If the player has trained some Farming:
4	line	Martin the Master Gardener	You've done some farming, haven't you noticed a decrease in the amount of produce you are getting lately?
4	select	Select an Option
4	option	Now that I think about it, you're right!
5	line	Player	Now that I think about it, you're right!
5	line	Martin the Master Gardener	I know I am. Depressing isn't it?
5	action	continues
4	option	No, can't say that I have.
5	line	Player	No, can't say that I have.
5	line	Martin the Master Gardener	That's not very observant of you.
3	box	Before starting this quest, be aware that your combat level is lower than the recommended level of 50. One or more of your skill levels are also lower than recommended.
3	select	Start the Fairytale I - Growing Pains quest?
3	option	Yes.
4	line	Player	So what do you want me to do?
4	line	Martin the Master Gardener	I'd like you to find out what is causing this terrible problem and to try and rectify whatever the problem is.
4	line	Player	Do you have any ideas where I should start?
4	line	Martin the Master Gardener	If I were you I would start by speaking to some of the other gardeners.
4	action	end
3	option	No.
4	line	Player	This doesn't sound like something I can help with. Good luck.
4	action	end
2	option	Oh dear. I hope you can sort them out by yourself.
3	line	Martin the Master Gardener	I'm not sure I can, but I guess I have to try.
3	action	end
2	option	What is the banner for?
3	line	Player	What is the banner for?
3	line	Martin the Master Gardener	That banner is the emblem of the Group of Advanced Gardeners. We're a loosely affiliated group of gardeners that are united in our concern for declining vegetable production.
3	line	Player	Err, of course you are.
3	line	Martin the Master Gardener	Say, you're a brave adventurer, would you be interested in trying to get to the root of our woes? There would be a cash reward if you could help us.
3	select	Select an Option
3	option	Of course I'll help.
4	line	Player	Of course I'll help.
4	line	Martin the Master Gardener	I'm so glad to hear that.
4	line	Player	You don't look it.
4	line	Martin the Master Gardener	Sorry, what was that?
4	line	Player	Oh, nothing. Don't worry about it.
4	line	Player	So tell me about your problems.
4	action	above
3	option	Sorry, I have better things to do.
4	line	Player	Sorry, I have better things to do.
4	line	Martin the Master Gardener	Oh. Oh dear. Oh well, if there's nothing I can do to make you change your mind...
4	line	Player	No, nothing. My mind is made up.
4	line	Martin the Master Gardener	Well come back and chat to me if you change it.
4	action	end
