1	line	Martin the Master Gardener	I'm afraid that can't be the problem. It never rains on the farming patches. That's why we have to water the crops.
1	line	Player	Oh, yeah. I hadn't thought of that.
1	line	Martin the Master Gardener	Go chat to some other group members. Maybe somebody has a different idea.
