1	select	Select an Option
1	option	Are you a member of the Group of Advanced Gardeners?
2	line	Player	Are you a member of the Group of Advanced Gardeners?
2	line	[Gardener #3]	Why, yes I am. Why do you ask?
2	line	Player	Martin has asked me to investigate why all the crops are failing.
2	line	[Gardener #3]	How can you ask such a thing? It's obvious! It's all you adventurers. Every time I get a crop planted, some adventurer comes along and digs it up and plants crops of their own, as if they owned my farming patch!
2	line	[Gardener #3]	It's really annoying! You should speak to your friends about their rude behaviour!
2	line	Player	But...but...they're not my friends! I've never even spoken to most of them!
2	line	[Gardener #3]	Don't give me that! You're an adventurer, they're all adventurers. I bet you have some sort of secret guild and you gather there and say things like 'let's annoy the gardeners this week', don't you?
2	line	Player	No, I mean yes. There is a heroes guild, but ...!
2	line	[Gardener #3]	Aha, so you admit it then! You should be ashamed of yourselves!
2	line	Player	Oh, I give up!
2	action	end
