0	section	Reporting to Martin
1	line	Player	One of your members is implying that the gardeners' problems are all caused by adventurers using the plots. I would like to point out that these plots are communal property and that we have as much right as anyone to
1	line	Player	grow plants here!
1	line	Martin the Master Gardener	All right! All right! You're absolutely right! I never said there was a problem with anybody using my plots. Besides, we get part of our income from watching crops for adventurers. I'm afraid that our problem is
1	line	Martin the Master Gardener	something totally different.
1	action	end
