1	select	Select an Option
1	option	Are you a member of the Group of Advanced Gardeners?
2	line	Player	Are you a member of the Group of Advanced Gardeners?
2	line	[Gardener #4]	Why, yes I am. Why do you ask?
2	line	Player	Martin has asked me to investigate why all the crops are failing.
2	line	[Gardener #4]	Well obviously it's the seasons. They all seem to be out-of-wack these days. Summer comes earlier and earlier each year, but then it simply rushes by!
2	line	[Gardener #4]	If you find out what is upsetting the seasons you'll find out what is causing the harvest to fail.
2	line	Player	I don't suppose you have any ideas about what could cause the seasons to be mixed up?
2	line	[Gardener #4]	No, sorry, but find that out and you'll get to the root of our problems.
2	action	end
