0	section	Talking to the Nature Spirit
1	line	Nature Spirit	Welcome back, my friend. I sensed that you require my help and so I have once more returned.
1	line	Player	Thank you! I need your help in enchanting a pair of secateurs.
1	line	Nature Spirit	Secateurs? That's a strange thing to enchant. Would you care to inform me why you need them?
1	line	Player	Sure. A Tanglefoot has invaded the fairy kingdom of Zanaris and the only way I can fight it is with a pair of enchanted secateurs, apparently.
1	line	Nature Spirit	Ah, a Tanglefoot! Your information is correct, secateurs that have been blessed by a Nature Spirit are the only weapons that can harm such a terrible creature.
1	line	Nature Spirit	I shall be glad to help you. Do you have all of the required items for the ceremony?
1	cond	If the player has the required items:
2	line	Player	Yes, I have everything right here.
2	line	Nature Spirit	Then let us begin...
2	line	Nature Spirit	It is done!
2	line	Nature Spirit	Farewell, {player} and good luck with your coming battle.
2	action	end
1	cond	If the player does not have the required items:
2	line	Player	No, I still need to collect some things.
2	line	Nature Spirit	Alright, my friend. Return to me when you have all that is required. I shall be waiting.
2	action	end
0	section	Talking to the Nature Spirit after losing the secateurs
