1	line	Player	I'm glad you're here. I'm afraid I've lost the secateurs you enchanted for me.
1	line	Nature Spirit	That's alright; if you bring me the components for the spell, I'll enchant another pair for you. Would you happen to have all of the required items for the ceremony with you now?
1	action	above
